{
  "_README": [
    "Issuer endpoint registry. Edit this file — no code change, no redeploy.",
    "",
    "verified=false keeps an issuer OUT of the live cascade entirely, so a",
    "broken URL can't slow down or pollute every lookup. Everything below is",
    "false because the URLs are UNCONFIRMED guesses that all failed in",
    "diagnose.py (schwab 404, vaneck 302 loop, globalx 404, wisdomtree 403,",
    "firsttrust 404, capitalgroup 404, troweprice 502).",
    "",
    "TO ENABLE ONE:",
    "  1. Open the issuer's fund page in a browser, devtools -> Network -> XHR.",
    "  2. Click the holdings tab / download link. Copy the request URL.",
    "  3. Paste it into catalog_url or holdings_url ({pid} = product id).",
    "  4. python issuer_catalog.py --probe <issuer>     (tests it, no commit)",
    "  5. Set verified=true once the probe passes.",
    "",
    "iShares note: the catalog URL is the product screener; holdings_url is the",
    "per-fund .ajax CSV. diagnose.py showed the CSV endpoint returning an HTML",
    "challenge page, so the holdings_url below likely needs the fund SLUG in",
    "place of the literal 'fund' segment, e.g. /us/products/239726/",
    "ishares-core-sp-500-etf/1467271812596.ajax?... Confirm in devtools."
  ],

